+## Refreshed 1.0.1 contract
+
+Installed `@earendil-works/pi-durable@1.0.1` exports `./testing`. `registerStorageConformance` is present at `dist/testing/index.d.ts`. The public `Storage` methods used here are `commit`, `mintId`, `conversation`, `scanConversations`, `entry`, `findLatestHeadMarker`, `scanEntries`, `task`, `scanTasks`, `submission`, `scanSubmissions`, `submissionByRequest`, `findDocument`, `document`, `scanDocuments` and `close`. DO SQL uses `storage.transaction` for async callbacks. `transactionSync` stays synchronous. No manual `BEGIN` or `SAVEPOINT`.
+
+Plaintext `fixtureDatabase` plus stock `SqliteStorage` remains only the explicit L0/L1 fixture path. A retained binding opens `EncryptedPiStorage` and seals host private columns. Structural effect routing lives in `host_effect_route`, not in ciphertext, because expiry and reconcile must keep filtering by run, operation and task.
 
